#: ../../source/docs/common-user-alerts.rst:7 22f00003490e45368262b1217738427c
msgid "User Alerts"
msgstr "用户警报"

#: ../../source/docs/common-user-alerts.rst:9 44c72b0ddfc945b6ad265f8c4190a881
msgid ""
"A User Alert is a formal report of an ArduPilot issue that may affect the "
"safe operation of a vehicle."
msgstr "用户警报是关于可能影响飞行器安全运行的 ArduPilot 问题的正式报告。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-user-alerts.rst:11
#: 6e805e066b49404a93a32c4252d3d4e8
msgid ""
"All ArduPilot users are strongly encouraged to regularly check this page for"
" any User Alerts that may affect their vehicles."
msgstr "强烈建议所有 ArduPilot 用户定期查看此页面，了解可能影响其飞行器的用户警报。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-user-alerts.rst:13
#: 756c99f7671c4a56809a7a1f2e9a6181
msgid ""
"User Alerts will only be for ArduPilot software issues. Manufacturer "
"hardware will not be included at this stage, although this may be reviewed "
"at a later date."
msgstr "用户警报仅针对 ArduPilot 软件问题。制造商硬件问题目前不在范围之内，但此政策可能在日后调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-user-alerts.rst:15
#: 9f04aafe88734898b9d44416628f7f34
msgid ""
"The User Alert documentation is available on the :ref:`developer wiki "
"<dev:user-alerts-developer>`."
msgstr "用户警报文档位于 :ref:`开发者 wiki <dev:user-alerts-developer>` 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-user-alerts.rst:17
#: 45445001a07949129aa954a5ab92937f
msgid ""
"For more information about a specific User Alert, see the `User Alert "
"Database <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/userAlerts/alerts.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"有关特定用户警报的更多信息，请参见 `用户警报数据库 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/userAlerts/alerts.html>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-user-alerts.rst:23
#: 1707bf012a71401ba56ba5832466d5f6
msgid ""
"All User Alerts reported from 16/09/2020 (or later) are in the User Alert "
"database. There is no guarantee that the database holds all User Alerts "
"reported before this date."
msgstr "2020 年 9 月 16 日（含）以后报告的所有用户警报均在用户警报数据库中。不保证数据库中包含此日期之前报告的所有用户警报。"

